Subject: RKWard 0.7.1b is available
Message-ID: <20200525221826.2bd5da6d@booklife>

Hi!

As announced, I have prepared a hotfix release to work around the
active binding bug in R 4.0.0. Users of R 4.0.0 are strongly
encouraged to upgrade to RKWard 0.7.1b.

The release also addresses two further issues. More details and
download links to be found at https://www.kde.org .

